[21.667988, "o", "deny\r\nA rule of this project’s record refuses a write at src/billing/invoice.ts while it stands.\r\n“Keep money as integer cents”: refuses a write at src/billing · \r\n01a1f735-486e-7000-8f74-985623b2a17b · accepted by mnid:b9901552 (no agent declared)\r\nThe rule opens with `mnema show 01a1f735-486e-7000-8f74-985623b2a17b`; changing it is a \r\ndecision for whoever recorded it.\r\nThis refusal covers the editing tools, not the shell: a write to a path a rule governs made \r\nthrough the shell goes round the rule, and is not one the record allows.\r\n"]
[24.075783, "o", "\u001b[2m# the refusal is a signed fact of the record, like the rule it cites\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.877713, "o", "\u001b[1m$\u001b[0m m"]
